      "type": "brief",
      "date": "2026-02-08T23:37:58.000Z",
      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹6.06 (vs ₹4.66 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹6.06 (up from ₹4.66 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹319.7b (up ₹316.9b from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹68.4b (up ₹67.9b from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 21% (up from 18% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 68% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 35% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "BriefActivity"
    },
